Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the source code of this project, and that is what you may
fork, modify and reuse as a portfolio template.

It grants no rights to the personal content, which remains © 2026 Muhammad Ishaq Khan,
all rights reserved:

  - the hero photograph (public/portrait.webp) and every other photograph of the
    site owner;
  - the curriculum vitae and other personal documents (public/resume.pdf,
    public/phishguard-thesis.pdf, public/tsinghua-offer.pdf);
  - the personal history written in portfolio.config.json — employment, education,
    achievements, contact details and likeness.

If you fork this project, replace that content with your own. It is not part of what
you are licensed to reuse, and re-publishing it as your own would misrepresent both
parties.
